 aT:'About Layers of the UAE',aP1:'Layers of the UAE maps the geology, archaeology and ecology of the UAE: places with their sources, a timeline from the Eocene sea to today, and live directions, in Arabic and English. Illustrated stories are on their way.',
 aP2:'Every record cites published research. AI connections are marked as untested ideas, never as findings.',
